      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Groin pain is frequent but often problematic as it covers a very broad differential diagnosis. The localisation of pain in one of the five anterior hip regions helps to establish a precise diagnosis and an adapted treatment. We review the differential diagnosis and treatment of anterior hip pain."},
